            <label for="relationship">Your relationship</label>
            <select id="relationship">
              <option>Active opportunity</option><option>Stalled deal</option><option>Existing customer</option><option>Former customer</option><option>Referral source</option><option>Lost opportunity</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="stage">Current sales stage</label>
            <select id="stage">
              <option>Proposal or quote</option><option>Discovery</option><option>Demo</option><option>Decision</option><option>No response</option><option>Not now</option><option>Post-sale</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="company">Company <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <input id="company" required autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Example: Acme Manufacturing">
        </div>
        <div class="two">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="prospectName">Prospect name (optional)</label>
            <input id="prospectName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Example: Jordan Lee">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="prospectRole">Prospect role (optional)</label>
            <input id="prospectRole" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Example: VP of Operations">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="situation">What actually happened?</label>
          <textarea id="situation" required placeholder="They liked the proposal but were concerned about implementation time. We agreed I would follow up after their planning meeting."></textarea>
          <small class="helper">Include objections, commitments, stakeholders, and what you already sent or promised.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="two">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="priority">What matters to them?</label>
            <input id="priority" placeholder="Implementation time, risk, growth">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="lastContact">Time since last contact (optional)</label>
            <input id="lastContact" placeholder="Example: 3 weeks">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="trigger">Useful trigger or new information (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="trigger" placeholder="A deadline, leadership change, internal update, relevant insight, or a resource you can genuinely provide."></textarea>
          <small class="helper">Only include verified facts. The strategist will not invent news, cases, metrics, or assets.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="nextStep">What next step do you want?</label>
          <input id="nextStep" placeholder="Example: a 15-minute decision call">
        </div>
        <button class="primary" id="submitButton" type="submit">Build four outreach plays</button>
        <div class="safe-note"><span class="safe-dot"></span><span>Cards and gifts are recommendations only. Nothing is ordered, mailed, or sent.</span></div>
        <div class="safe-note"><span class="safe-dot"></span><span>Your current draft and contact records stay private to this browser and device unless you download or export them.</span></div>
      </form>

      <div class="result-panel" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="status" id="status" role="status"></div>
        <div class="empty" id="emptyState">
          <div class="empty-mark">R</div>
          <h2>The message comes second.</h2>
          <p>First, find a legitimate reason this person should want to hear from you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="results" id="results">
          <div class="diagnosis">
            <div>
              <div class="section-label">Situation diagnosis</div>
              <h2 id="diagnosisTitle">A reason is missing.</h2>
              <p id="diagnosisCopy"></p>
            </div>
            <span class="diagnosis-badge" id="diagnosisBadge">Customer-centered</span>
          </div>
          <div class="action-bar" id="actionBar" aria-label="Plan actions">
            <button type="button" id="downloadPdf">Download PDF</button>
            <button type="button" id="emailPdf">Email this plan<span class="setup-label">Email setup required</span></button>
            <p class="action-note" id="actionNote">PDFs are made on this device. Your prospect details are not uploaded for PDF creation.</p>
            <details><summary>Owner tools</summary><div class="owner-tools"><button type="button" id="exportCsv">Export GHL lead CSV</button><span id="ownerToolsMessage" role="status"></span></div></details>
          </div>
          <div class="section-label">Four ranked sales plays — select one</div>
          <div class="reasons" id="reasonList"></div>
          <div class="scorecard" id="scorecard"></div>
          <div class="composer" id="composer">
            <h3>Channel plan</h3>
            <p class="composer-sub" id="scriptByline">Written from you to the prospect.</p>
            <div class="plan" id="playPlan"></div>
            <div class="section-label">What you can say to the prospect</div>
            <div class="channels" id="channels" role="tablist" aria-label="Contact channel"></div>
            <div class="advisory" id="advisory"><strong>Recommendation only.</strong><span>No card, gift, order, or message will be sent from this demo.</span></div>
            <div class="recommendation" id="recommendation"><strong id="recLabel"></strong><span id="recCopy"></span></div>
            <div class="message-box" id="messageBox"><span id="messageText"></span><button type="button" class="copy" id="copyButton">Copy wording</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="method">
    <div class="shell method-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The method</span>
        <h2>Persistence without relevance is pestering.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="method-copy">
        <div class="method-card"><b>Diagnose first</b><p>Understand the real situation before generating another message.</p></div>
        <div class="method-card"><b>Create value</b><p>Bring something useful, timely, clarifying, or genuinely human.</p></div>
        <div class="method-card"><b>Score the reason</b><p>Test relevance, newness, value, decision help, and prospect benefit.</p></div>
        <div class="method-card"><b>Choose the channel</b><p>Email is not always the answer. A thoughtful card or appropriate gift can create a better moment.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<div class="overlay" id="captureOverlay" aria-hidden="true">
  <section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="captureTitle">
    <div class="modal-head"><div><h2 id="captureTitle">Download your plan</h2><p class="modal-copy">These fields belong to you—the person using this app—not the prospect in the plan.</p></div><button type="button" class="icon-button close-modal" aria-label="Close contact form">×</button></div>
    <form id="contactForm">
      <div class="field"><label for="ownerFirstName">Your first name (app user)</label><input id="ownerFirstName" required autocomplete="given-name"></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ownerEmail">Your work email (app user)</label><input id="ownerEmail" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="ownerCompany">Your company (app user, optional)</label><input id="ownerCompany" autocomplete="organization"></div>
      <div class="consent"><input id="nurtureConsent" type="checkbox"><label for="nurtureConsent">Send me occasional practical ideas for improving sales follow-up and customer nurturing.</label></div>
      <p class="modal-copy">Marketing consent is not required to receive your requested plan. This initial test stores only your minimal contact record in this browser.</p>
      <div class="modal-actions"><button class="primary" id="confirmCapture" type="submit">Download PDF</button><button type="button" class="secondary close-modal">Cancel</button></div>
      <p id="captureMessage" class="modal-copy" role="status"></p>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
