+    },
+    {
+      "rank": 4, "title": "Useful pause with a checkpoint", "strategicAngle": "Give the customer control over timing while leaving a concrete re-entry point.", "whyNow": "A respectful pause protects the relationship if internal comparison work is still underway.", "valueToBring": "Summarize the verified window dates and the one open sequencing question in a concise recap.", "primaryChannel": "Mailed card", "sequence": ["Mail the concise recap.", "Pause unless the customer responds or the agreed checkpoint arrives."], "rationale": "Respectful and low pressure, though it provides less immediate decision help than the top plays.",
+      "rubric": {"relevance":2,"newness":1,"value":1,"decisionHelp":1,"prospectBenefit":2,"total":7},
+      "scripts": {"Email":"Subject: A clean checkpoint\n\nHi Jordan,\n\nI know your team is still comparing options. I summarized the maintenance windows you shared and the one sequencing question that remains open. I’m happy to send it, then leave timing with you.\n\nAvery","Call opener":"Hi Jordan, this is Avery. I don’t want to add noise while your team compares options. I prepared a concise recap of the verified windows and one open sequencing question. Would that be useful before I step back?\n\nAvery","Voicemail":"Hi Jordan, this is Avery. I prepared a concise recap of the maintenance windows and one open sequencing question. I’ll send a short note, then leave the timing with you.\n\nAvery","Text":"Hi Jordan—Avery here. I summarized the verified windows and one open sequencing question. Would the short recap help while your team compares options?\n\nAvery","LinkedIn":"Hi Jordan, I prepared a concise recap of the verified maintenance windows and one remaining sequencing question. Happy to share it, then leave timing with you.\n\nAvery","Mailed card":"Hi Jordan,\n\nI know your team is comparing options, so I wanted to leave a clean recap rather than another follow-up request. I noted the maintenance windows you shared and the one sequencing question still open. I’m happy to help when the timing is useful.\n\nAvery","Gift/leave-behind":"Hi Jordan,\n\nThis concise checkpoint captures the verified maintenance windows and the one sequencing question still open. I hope it is useful while your team compares options; there is no expectation attached.\n\nAvery"}
+    }
+  ]
+}
